
<div class="sunnyeora-hero-carousel" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 30px; background: #FAF9F5;">
  <div style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; position: relative;">
    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0D5C3A 0%, #083823 60%, #1E293B 100%); border-radius: 24px; padding: 50px 40px; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; flex-wrap: wrap; box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(13,92,58,0.18);">
      <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px;">
        <span style="background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); color: #34D399; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.4); padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;">🌿 PREMIUM BIO-TESTED WELLNESS</span>
        <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 16px 0; line-height: 1.15; color: #fff;">FEEL RESTED, REJUVENATED & CONFIDENT</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #D1FAE5; margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 550px; line-height: 1.6;">Comfort-crafted cervical sleep pillows, therapeutic red light wands, and sonic cleaners designed to transform your daily routine.</p>
        
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/collections/all" style="background: #34D399; color: #092B1C; text-decoration: none; padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 900; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(52,211,153,0.3); transition: transform 0.2s;">
            SHOP ALL CATEGORIES ➔
          </a>
          <span style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #A7F3D0; font-weight: 700;">🇺🇸 Free USPS Air Express Delivery</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; width: 140px;">
          <div style="font-size: 2.2rem;">🛏️</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 8px;">Cervical Sleep</div>
          <div style="color: #FCD34D; font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 4px;">UP TO 45% OFF</div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; width: 140px;">
          <div style="font-size: 2.2rem;">✨</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 8px;">Skincare Tech</div>
          <div style="color: #FCD34D; font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 4px;">SAVE $40</div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; width: 140px;">
          <div style="font-size: 2.2rem;">💎</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 8px;">Sonic Clean</div>
          <div style="color: #FCD34D; font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 4px;">TOP RATED</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

